About dataset_split:
- Used to split the dataset into training (0.9) and test (0.1) sets.
        - dataset_split.json : volumes separated by pacients
        - dataset_split2.json : slices separated by pacients
- Info about split 2:   
        Train patients: 870
        Test patients: 97
        Train slices: 176140
        Test slices: 21847